* C4: resistive shunt-feedback CS LNA with shunt-peaked load (wideband;
* Bruccoleri/Klumperink/Nauta wideband-LNA lineage + Mohan et al. JSSC 2000
* shunt peaking). Broadband real input match via R1 feedback; targets the
* 0.5-3 GHz cells (e08/h08). Structure only. Round-1 external, approved
* 2026-09-11.
C C1 VIN1 n1
R R1 n1 n2
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 VSS VSS
L L1 VDD n3
R R2 n3 n2
C C2 n2 VOUT1
